(6604369, 985413, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like the message of the shot and the way you have answered the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the message of the shot and the way you have answered the challenge.', '2011-11-27 12:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604370, 985436, 60047, '<td valign="top">A nice, bright shot.A good answer for the challenge.</td>', 'A nice, bright shot.A good answer for the challenge.', '2011-11-27 12:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604371, 985390, 60047, '<td valign="top">An ideal macro shot.Nice work.</td>', 'An ideal macro shot.Nice work.', '2011-11-27 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604372, 985462, 60047, '<td valign="top">Priceless. A great answer to this challenge. Love the B&amp;W. The title is a nice compliment of a shot that really does not need one.</td>', 'Priceless. A great answer to this challenge. Love the B&W. The title is a nice compliment of a shot that really does not need one.', '2011-11-27 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604374, 985546, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of capturing a youngster tackling the responsibility of carving the turkey. I think the background is a bit distracting, though.</td>', 'I like the idea of capturing a youngster tackling the responsibility of carving the turkey. I think the background is a bit distracting, though.', '2011-11-27 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604375, 985456, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! A great moment.</td>', 'Nice capture! A great moment.', '2011-11-27 12:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604376, 985404, 60047, '<td valign="top">A cool take on this challenge. Edgy &amp; well executed.</td>', 'A cool take on this challenge. Edgy & well executed.', '2011-11-27 12:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604378, 985446, 60047, '<td valign="top">A necessary practice in our homes - but one to capture on film for a photo challenge titled "Feast II"? Probably not a good choice for this challenge. I would have left this one for the Free Study - and I bet it would have scored a lot better.  <br/> <br/>It is a wonderfully disturbing image - and one that will no doubt earn the wrath of many due to the contrasting tone of the rest of the challenge submissions. I think the title detracts from the power of the image - and it is a well composed and powerful image.</td>', 'A necessary practice in our homes - but one to capture on film for a photo challenge titled "Feast II"? Probably not a good choice for this challenge. I would have left this one for the Free Study - and I bet it would have scored a lot better.   It is a wonderfully disturbing image - and one that will no doubt earn the wrath of many due to the contrasting tone of the rest of the challenge submissions. I think the title detracts from the power of the image - and it is a well composed and powerful image.', '2011-11-27 12:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604379, 985459, 60047, '<td valign="top">The light is a little harsh on this one...but it sure looks tasty!</td>', 'The light is a little harsh on this one...but it sure looks tasty!', '2011-11-27 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604380, 985450, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2011-11-27 12:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604381, 985322, 60047, '<td valign="top">A good attempt at more of an edgy approach to the challenge.</td>', 'A good attempt at more of an edgy approach to the challenge.', '2011-11-27 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604383, 985443, 60047, '<td valign="top">Cant quite understand what is going on with the skewers - especially at their insertion points. They appear to be added in post-processing (though I am assuming for voting purposes this is not the case). I love the focus and detail on the contrasting brie and walnut.</td>', 'Cant quite understand what is going on with the skewers - especially at their insertion points. They appear to be added in post-processing (though I am assuming for voting purposes this is not the case). I love the focus and detail on the contrasting brie and walnut.', '2011-11-27 13:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6604385, 985465, 60047, '<td valign="top">The food looks marvelous. Very unexpected colors tones in the table and umbrella - making for a very different answer to this challenge.</td>', 'The food looks marvelous. Very unexpected colors tones in the table and umbrella - making for a very different answer to this challenge.', '2011-11-27 13:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
