(6611113, 985342, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww.... how appropriate that you would win a blue ribbon in a photo depicting your wonderful family life.  Congratulations, Lydia!  This is the best!<br/></td>', 'Awwww.... how appropriate that you would win a blue ribbon in a photo depicting your wonderful family life.  Congratulations, Lydia!  This is the best!', '2011-12-05 09:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6611189, 985546, 68947, '<td valign="top">Whaddya mean you don''t live in a studio?  You mean to tell me that you don''t use your diningroom table, kitchen, basement and everywhere else to set up elaborate lighting set-ups, strobes, reflectors and everything else that goes along with what people "good photography" here in DPC????!!!  I''m SHOCKED!!!  How DARE you enter a photo like that! <br/> <br/>ROFLMAO!!!  (Loved that comment...as you can tell:)) <br/> <br/>Actually loved this shot, Michelle.  Shows the determination on B-Man''s face.  He''s actually doing quite a fine job too.  Can he come carve my turkey at Christmas? <br/> <br/>BTW...it looks like a really moist bird.  Bet it was yummy. Kudos to you and B. :)</td>', 'Whaddya mean you don''t live in a studio?  You mean to tell me that you don''t use your diningroom table, kitchen, basement and everywhere else to set up elaborate lighting set-ups, strobes, reflectors and everything else that goes along with what people "good photography" here in DPC????!!!  I''m SHOCKED!!!  How DARE you enter a photo like that!  ROFLMAO!!!  (Loved that comment...as you can tell:))  Actually loved this shot, Michelle.  Shows the determination on B-Man''s face.  He''s actually doing quite a fine job too.  Can he come carve my turkey at Christmas?  BTW...it looks like a really moist bird.  Bet it was yummy. Kudos to you and B. :)', '2011-12-05 11:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
