(6611248, 985462, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, Ben. Congratulations on the ribbon. I''m laughing at the plate with almost nothing eaten. You have brought back a strong memory for me.<br/> <br/>At one Thanksgiving dinner, the elderly host said to my 3-year-old daughter, "You didn''t like your dinner?" My daughter replied, "Oh yes, I tasted everything, and it was delicious!" To that the host replied, "Cory, you are a most delightful liar.", and my daughter beamed with pleasure.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, Ben. Congratulations on the ribbon. I''m laughing at the plate with almost nothing eaten. You have brought back a strong memory for me. At one Thanksgiving dinner, the elderly host said to my 3-year-old daughter, "You didn''t like your dinner?" My daughter replied, "Oh yes, I tasted everything, and it was delicious!" To that the host replied, "Cory, you are a most delightful liar.", and my daughter beamed with pleasure.', '2011-12-05 14:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
